<title>BOTSWANA: Sefalana yr share rises, div steady.</title>
<headline>Sefalana yr share rises, div steady.</headline>
<dateline>GABORONE 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr ended 31 October 1996</p>
<p>			(million pula unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (thebe)		     460    vs  400</p>
<p>    Final Div (thebe) 25 making  40    vs   40</p>
<p>    Attrib income		     8.51 vs   19.53</p>
<p>    Pre-tax			    14.67 vs   19.12</p>
<p>    Tax				   4.14 vs    3.12</p>
<p>    Turnover			  195.50 vs  131.36</p>
<p>    Income from associate	   9.05 vs    9.50</p>
<p>Div payable: first week February 1997.</p>
<p>On register: January 17 1997.</p>
<p>Full name: Sefalana Holding Company Limited.</p>
<p>NOTE - The directors said in a statement every effort was being made to contain costs and improve efficiency. A strategic reassessment of strengths and weaknesses was continuing and had already yielded significant improvements in certain divisions. However, recovery in the year ahead would depend on market conditions.</p>
<p>-- Gaborone newsroom +267 347182</p>
</text>
